Caro Luciano,

Segue um exemplo.


library(RColorBrewer)

par(mfrow=c(2,2))

for(i in 1:4){
mypalette <- brewer.pal(7,"Greys")
image(1:7,1,as.matrix(1:7),col=mypalette,xlab="Greens (sequential)",
      ylab="",xaxt="n",yaxt="n",bty="n")
}

legend(1, 1, title = "test",legend = c("Solo1", "Solo2"), pch = 1, col = 1, cex = 1)

Obs: 1 e 1 corresponde, respectivamente, x e y.

 
